WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.500
Step 1: Open the incident form. Incidents > Report an incident.

2
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.500
Step 2: Describe the issue and set priority. Short description, category, impact and urgency.

3
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:22.500
Step 3: Attach a file and submit. Optional attachments, then Submit.

4
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:29.500
Step 4: The ticket is created. Reference ID, status flow and SLA timer appear.

5
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:44.500
Step 5: Reply to the requester. Public replies or internal notes.

6
00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:00.500
Step 6: Switch to the assignee. The employee signs in and sees notifications.

7
00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:23.500
Step 7: Read the conversation. Replies and details are on the ticket.

8
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.500
Step 8: Accept the ticket. Assignees accept or decline with a reason.

9
00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:11.500
Step 9: Update progress. A note, percentage complete and status move.

10
00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:30.500
Step 10: Track the result. The ticket moves to In progress and stays on record.

